WEBVTT

00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:03.240
Imaginary weapons?

00:00:03.240 --> 00:00:07.810
In order to do matter conversions 
more precisely and efficiently,

00:00:07.810 --> 00:00:10.470
we conjure weapons with dark matter.

00:00:11.010 --> 00:00:13.390
Okay, I'll try it.

00:00:21.710 --> 00:00:24.170
My power.

00:00:24.990 --> 00:00:27.800
All my power.

00:00:28.360 --> 00:00:31.050
My... My...

00:00:31.050 --> 00:00:32.410
Tear.

00:00:33.990 --> 00:00:35.330
You're a Dragon.

00:00:35.600 --> 00:00:36.290
A Dragon.

00:00:36.590 --> 00:00:37.820
A Dragon.

00:00:37.820 --> 00:00:44.060
A Dragon...

00:00:44.060 --> 00:00:44.970
I'm...

00:00:51.950 --> 00:00:52.960
Tear-san.

00:01:37.910 --> 00:01:40.150
There's no reason to be upset.

00:01:40.150 --> 00:01:42.930
It isn't real.

00:01:43.960 --> 00:01:44.900
Who...

00:01:45.510 --> 00:01:48.990
Now, get rid of everything false.

00:01:48.990 --> 00:01:51.000
Become your true self.

00:01:51.660 --> 00:01:54.730
You're a Dragon.

00:02:17.610 --> 00:02:23.910
<b><i>Unlimited Fafnir</i></b>

00:03:32.650 --> 00:03:36.450
<b>Muspelheim of the Flames</b>

00:03:38.850 --> 00:03:41.290
I'm a Dragon.

00:03:58.530 --> 00:03:59.210
Lisa!

00:04:03.960 --> 00:04:05.640
Wh-Wh-Wh-Wh—

00:04:05.960 --> 00:04:07.740
Where do you think you're touching?

00:04:10.300 --> 00:04:12.030
S-Sorry.

00:04:13.990 --> 00:04:17.510
That Dragon is Tear-san, isn't it?

00:04:17.510 --> 00:04:22.110
I suspect the imaginary weapon 
is taking the shape of a Dragon.

00:04:22.420 --> 00:04:26.410
Right now, Tear is completely 
convinced that she's a Dragon.

00:04:27.570 --> 00:04:30.790
Then we need to make her snap out of it.

00:04:31.460 --> 00:04:32.750
Gungnir!

00:04:46.330 --> 00:04:47.590
Pierce!

00:04:47.590 --> 00:04:48.580
Flare!

00:04:56.160 --> 00:04:57.470
I won't let you.

00:05:07.410 --> 00:05:10.210
Wake up, Tear-san!

00:05:10.480 --> 00:05:11.480
Pierce!

00:05:11.480 --> 00:05:12.370
Flare!

00:05:21.830 --> 00:05:22.450
Tear!

00:05:26.930 --> 00:05:28.010
Tear.

00:05:28.010 --> 00:05:28.680
Tear!

00:05:30.220 --> 00:05:31.510
Yuu.

00:05:45.290 --> 00:05:49.730
<i>If she causes any more harm, she'll...</i>

00:05:50.840 --> 00:05:53.250
<i>I'll have to talk to her when she wakes up.</i>

00:05:57.860 --> 00:05:59.670
S-Sorry.

00:05:59.670 --> 00:06:01.500
I-It's okay.

00:06:02.170 --> 00:06:04.420
You're, uh...

00:06:05.250 --> 00:06:07.170
Tachikawa Honoka.

00:06:08.030 --> 00:06:11.680
Nice to meet you, Mononobe Yuu-san.

00:06:12.170 --> 00:06:13.510
You know me?

00:06:14.070 --> 00:06:15.050
Yes.

00:06:15.050 --> 00:06:18.740
You're the only man in the academy.

00:06:18.740 --> 00:06:20.070
Oh, yeah.

00:06:20.070 --> 00:06:21.380
Did you get hurt or something?

00:06:21.890 --> 00:06:23.340
Yes.

00:06:23.340 --> 00:06:26.820
I messed up a matter 
conversion during practice,

00:06:26.820 --> 00:06:28.270
and I got some scrapes.

00:06:28.960 --> 00:06:30.170
I see.

00:06:30.670 --> 00:06:31.510
Sorry to intrude.

00:06:31.510 --> 00:06:32.450
Um...

00:06:32.980 --> 00:06:34.490
If it's all right with you,

00:06:34.490 --> 00:06:36.480
could you help me with something?

00:06:37.150 --> 00:06:40.530
I can't quite reach.

00:06:40.530 --> 00:06:42.280
M-Me?

00:06:43.690 --> 00:06:48.330
Please... Be gentle.

00:06:48.950 --> 00:06:49.880
Sure.

00:06:57.210 --> 00:07:03.990
S-So, you were rescued at a city in the 
Basilisk's trajectory, weren't you?

00:07:04.580 --> 00:07:06.170
Why were you there?

00:07:06.570 --> 00:07:09.730
My mother travels around the world.

00:07:10.810 --> 00:07:14.120
I moved around with her.

00:07:14.700 --> 00:07:17.620
Don't you feel lonely, being 
torn apart from her so suddenly?

00:07:18.250 --> 00:07:22.170
No, we had quite a cold relationship.

00:07:22.690 --> 00:07:25.350
I don't have a father or any relatives,

00:07:25.850 --> 00:07:28.710
so in a way, I was with 
her because I had to be.

00:07:29.360 --> 00:07:32.930
So if anything, I'm glad 
I have my independence.

00:07:34.230 --> 00:07:36.060
You're strong.

00:07:40.640 --> 00:07:42.420
Thank you.

00:07:42.990 --> 00:07:44.610
It's no big deal.

00:07:45.240 --> 00:07:48.370
Anyway, no one came with you?

00:07:48.900 --> 00:07:51.750
I haven't gotten used to class yet.

00:07:51.750 --> 00:07:53.240
I don't have friends yet, either.

00:07:53.920 --> 00:07:54.930
Oh.

00:07:55.700 --> 00:07:59.450
Let me know if you ever need anything.

00:08:01.830 --> 00:08:02.680
Okay.

00:08:03.170 --> 00:08:06.070
I hope to see you around, Tachikawa.

00:08:06.070 --> 00:08:07.630
Call me Honoka.

00:08:08.210 --> 00:08:09.420
Is it okay

00:08:10.750 --> 00:08:13.350
if I call you by name, too?

00:08:13.350 --> 00:08:16.170
Sure... Honoka.

00:08:16.660 --> 00:08:18.580
Okay, Yuu-san.

00:08:18.580 --> 00:08:19.830
I'll be going now.

00:08:31.620 --> 00:08:32.170
Yes?

00:08:32.840 --> 00:08:35.090
Hey, Lieutenant Mononobe.

00:08:36.650 --> 00:08:39.280
<i>There's something that's been bothering me.</i>

00:08:39.280 --> 00:08:41.980
<i>I thought I should let you know about it.</i>

00:08:42.780 --> 00:08:47.150
<i>The Dragon cultists are starting an 
operation to rescue Tear Lightning.</i>

00:08:47.150 --> 00:08:47.750
Huh?

00:08:48.380 --> 00:08:50.990
Midgar's defenses are tough.

00:08:50.990 --> 00:08:53.010
It won't be easy for them to infiltrate.

00:08:53.550 --> 00:08:57.130
Which means <i>she</i> will mobilize.

00:08:57.130 --> 00:08:59.560
<i>"She"? You don't mean...</i>

00:08:59.560 --> 00:09:00.780
Yeah.

00:09:00.780 --> 00:09:03.360
The anti-NIFL D...

00:09:03.360 --> 00:09:06.060
Kili Surtr Muspelheim.

00:09:06.060 --> 00:09:07.690
<i>You mean </i>the<i> Kili?</i>

00:09:07.690 --> 00:09:10.400
We can trust her to take some kind of action.

00:09:10.750 --> 00:09:13.680
<i>We expect severe casualties when she does.</i>

00:09:14.940 --> 00:09:17.250
<i>I'll send you the newest data later.</i>

00:09:17.780 --> 00:09:19.340
If it comes to it,

00:09:19.950 --> 00:09:23.180
<i>I'm counting on you, Lieutenant Mononobe.</i>

00:09:24.160 --> 00:09:26.830
I'll keep it in mind, Major Loki.

00:09:30.330 --> 00:09:31.470
Kili...

00:09:32.500 --> 00:09:33.410
Yuu!

00:09:33.410 --> 00:09:35.880
Yuu!

00:09:36.150 --> 00:09:37.300
Tear.

00:09:37.300 --> 00:09:38.050
Yuu!

00:09:38.050 --> 00:09:40.800
Why was I asleep?

00:09:40.800 --> 00:09:41.640
Where's Lisa?

00:09:41.640 --> 00:09:42.570
Where's everyone else?

00:09:43.050 --> 00:09:44.070
Tear...

00:09:47.800 --> 00:09:50.610
Let's talk about something important.

00:10:01.230 --> 00:10:02.640
So, Tear,

00:10:02.640 --> 00:10:05.890
do you like everyone more 
than you did yesterday?

00:10:05.890 --> 00:10:06.790
Yeah.

00:10:06.790 --> 00:10:09.640
Lisa and the rest are nice people.

00:10:10.910 --> 00:10:11.890
That's good.

00:10:12.590 --> 00:10:13.450
What about you?

00:10:14.390 --> 00:10:20.610
But just earlier, you almost hurt Lisa.

00:10:21.620 --> 00:10:26.180
You became a Dragon and went berserk. 
The practice room was a mess.

00:10:26.180 --> 00:10:27.770
No...

00:10:27.770 --> 00:10:29.650
I did that?

00:10:29.960 --> 00:10:31.110
Yeah.

00:10:31.110 --> 00:10:33.040
I know it wasn't on purpose.

00:10:33.530 --> 00:10:37.590
That's why you have to apologize 
to everyone and make a promise.

00:10:38.210 --> 00:10:39.890
Promise?

00:10:40.860 --> 00:10:44.700
That you won't think you're 
a Dragon from now on.

00:10:45.100 --> 00:10:46.970
But I'm...

00:10:47.610 --> 00:10:50.330
You're a cute human girl.

00:10:50.790 --> 00:10:51.850
I'm not!

00:10:54.350 --> 00:10:55.710
I'm not.

00:10:55.710 --> 00:10:58.090
I'm a Dragon.

00:10:58.090 --> 00:11:01.010
Look at the powers I have.

00:11:02.740 --> 00:11:06.730
We all have the same powers, including me.

00:11:07.070 --> 00:11:09.270
But we're living as humans.

00:11:10.520 --> 00:11:11.930
Humans?

00:11:12.690 --> 00:11:15.270
If you say you're going to live as a Dragon,

00:11:15.990 --> 00:11:17.430
we can't be together.

00:11:18.650 --> 00:11:22.910
I want you to choose to live as a human.

00:11:28.410 --> 00:11:31.400
Where are your father and mother, Tear?

00:11:33.560 --> 00:11:35.500
They were fakes.

00:11:36.190 --> 00:11:37.590
Fakes?

00:11:37.590 --> 00:11:40.350
They were nice.

00:11:40.870 --> 00:11:43.920
But they burned up.

00:11:53.990 --> 00:11:59.010
All I had was Kili.

00:12:00.320 --> 00:12:02.070
I can't take it!

00:12:02.320 --> 00:12:04.480
They all burned!

00:12:04.480 --> 00:12:07.650
My house, and my parents!

00:12:08.070 --> 00:12:10.610
They're all fakes.

00:12:11.120 --> 00:12:12.900
They aren't real.

00:12:13.950 --> 00:12:15.990
So it's okay.

00:12:17.040 --> 00:12:17.980
All right.

00:12:18.510 --> 00:12:19.700
I got it.

00:12:21.140 --> 00:12:24.450
Thanks for telling me, Tear.

00:12:38.230 --> 00:12:41.730
Welcome back, Nii-san, Tear-san.

00:12:41.730 --> 00:12:44.070
We were all worried.

00:12:53.570 --> 00:12:54.500
Lisa.

00:12:56.100 --> 00:12:58.330
I... I'm sorry.

00:12:58.760 --> 00:13:02.540
I caused you all trouble.

00:13:04.240 --> 00:13:07.530
So I'm sorry.

00:13:12.000 --> 00:13:13.500
About what happened earlier?

00:13:13.940 --> 00:13:15.860
It never bothered us.

00:13:17.320 --> 00:13:18.270
Me, neither.

00:13:20.510 --> 00:13:21.950
All right.

00:13:22.430 --> 00:13:26.350
Then here's your punishment.

00:13:30.320 --> 00:13:31.410
Ow.

00:13:31.410 --> 00:13:35.160
Those who want to atone need 
to be given punishment.

00:13:36.050 --> 00:13:40.510
They have to be disciplined before 
they're overcome by feelings of guilt.

00:13:40.930 --> 00:13:42.650
It hurts.

00:13:42.650 --> 00:13:45.330
And now you've made amends.

00:13:46.610 --> 00:13:49.470
You don't need to worry about it anymore.

00:13:49.860 --> 00:13:51.330
Lisa.

00:13:51.330 --> 00:13:55.560
I thought I went pretty easy on you. 
Does it still hurt?

00:13:55.560 --> 00:13:56.640
No.

00:13:56.640 --> 00:13:59.110
Thanks, Lisa.

00:14:00.170 --> 00:14:01.850
You're like a mother.

00:14:04.560 --> 00:14:08.230
Hey, since we have tomorrow 
off, let's hang out.

00:14:08.930 --> 00:14:09.990
All of us?

00:14:19.210 --> 00:14:21.670
Mononobe! Tear-chan!

00:14:22.310 --> 00:14:24.100
Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:14:24.590 --> 00:14:25.560
Iris.

00:14:26.910 --> 00:14:29.840
What do you think? I just bought it.

00:14:30.150 --> 00:14:33.740
Oh, yeah, your last one got 
washed away by the waves.

00:14:34.250 --> 00:14:38.210
Don't remember stuff like that.

00:14:38.690 --> 00:14:40.120
It's embarrassing.

00:14:41.990 --> 00:14:43.940
You really are pretty.

00:14:44.180 --> 00:14:45.730
Wh-Wh-Wh-Wha—

00:14:46.690 --> 00:14:50.070
Don't say that, or I'll...

00:14:52.260 --> 00:14:53.370
Sorry.

00:14:54.060 --> 00:14:55.920
Yuu, what about me?

00:14:55.920 --> 00:14:57.310
What do you think of me?

00:14:57.790 --> 00:14:59.780
Hm? Oh...

00:15:00.170 --> 00:15:01.730
You're cute, Tear.

00:15:03.720 --> 00:15:06.430
I don't want to be cute.

00:15:06.800 --> 00:15:10.610
Fine! Then Iris is my rival!

00:15:10.610 --> 00:15:12.470
Me? Your rival?

00:15:12.880 --> 00:15:14.090
Yeah!

00:15:14.090 --> 00:15:16.720
I won't lose to you!

00:15:18.030 --> 00:15:20.730
The first one to make the stick fall loses.

00:15:21.220 --> 00:15:22.430
Got it.

00:15:22.430 --> 00:15:24.670
I accept your challenge.

00:15:29.890 --> 00:15:31.320
I've got this.

00:15:37.360 --> 00:15:40.520
I'll show you my technique!

00:15:44.920 --> 00:15:47.050
I win!

00:15:47.050 --> 00:15:49.800
Tear-chan, let's play again.

00:15:50.190 --> 00:15:51.840
Challenge accepted.

00:15:51.840 --> 00:15:54.180
This time, I'll show you my technique!

00:15:54.180 --> 00:15:55.720
You're never going to win!

00:15:57.070 --> 00:16:01.610
I'm reluctant to let you see me 
in a swimsuit, but here I am.

00:16:01.610 --> 00:16:02.890
Hey!

00:16:05.330 --> 00:16:09.880
It looked like you were choosing 
pretty carefully, though.

00:16:09.880 --> 00:16:11.870
Yeah. Yeah.

00:16:12.190 --> 00:16:14.570
I-I don't come to the beach too often.

00:16:14.570 --> 00:16:16.660
I don't like getting sunburned.

00:16:16.660 --> 00:16:18.700
I had a hard time choosing 
because I'm not used to it.

00:16:19.700 --> 00:16:23.310
Um, I think it looks good on you.

00:16:23.580 --> 00:16:25.450
O-Of course it does.

00:16:25.450 --> 00:16:28.510
You don't need to tell me that. I know!

00:16:29.380 --> 00:16:29.970
Ow!

00:16:30.840 --> 00:16:34.970
Nii-san, that's borderline sexual harassment.

00:16:35.940 --> 00:16:38.060
I just told her what I thought.

00:16:38.520 --> 00:16:41.950
You can't complain if you get 
called out on sexual harassment

00:16:41.950 --> 00:16:44.500
for judging a woman in 
a swimsuit so casually.

00:16:45.150 --> 00:16:49.030
Then I shouldn't say anything 
about you, right, Mitsuki?

00:16:49.430 --> 00:16:54.070
I won't get embarrassed 
by anything you say to me.

00:16:54.780 --> 00:16:56.310
Do as you like.

00:16:57.730 --> 00:16:59.330
In that case,

00:17:00.560 --> 00:17:02.250
it looks good on you.

00:17:02.250 --> 00:17:03.960
Your back is pretty sexy.

00:17:07.630 --> 00:17:10.350
Y-You told me to do as I liked!

00:17:14.050 --> 00:17:16.250
I win again!

00:17:16.250 --> 00:17:19.420
One more time, okay? One more time!

00:17:31.930 --> 00:17:33.530
Even here, you're reading a book?

00:17:34.400 --> 00:17:35.770
It's fun.

00:17:35.770 --> 00:17:38.170
But you're at the beach.

00:17:38.170 --> 00:17:40.010
You should bust out a little more.

00:17:40.010 --> 00:17:42.650
How about we play beach 
volleyball or something?

00:17:43.220 --> 00:17:47.450
Just for you, there'll be a penalty 
if you drop the ball even once.

00:17:47.450 --> 00:17:48.780
Just me?

00:17:48.780 --> 00:17:52.040
There's only one gentleman here.

00:17:52.770 --> 00:17:54.550
It's a fitting handicap.

00:17:56.090 --> 00:17:57.330
Sounds fun.

00:18:00.850 --> 00:18:02.610
Here we go.

00:18:13.180 --> 00:18:14.490
Nothing's biting...

00:18:20.420 --> 00:18:21.730
The first star.

00:18:23.250 --> 00:18:26.120
What do you think? I worked hard on it.

00:18:26.690 --> 00:18:28.750
Yeah, it's heavy.

00:18:34.630 --> 00:18:37.150
There you go. You did well.

00:18:37.150 --> 00:18:38.030
Really?

00:18:38.560 --> 00:18:40.570
Was I swimming?

00:18:40.570 --> 00:18:41.470
Yes.

00:18:42.620 --> 00:18:45.770
Teach me more, Lisa.

00:18:45.770 --> 00:18:47.560
You mustn't push yourself too much.

00:18:50.750 --> 00:18:53.570
It looks like you're having fun.

00:18:54.530 --> 00:18:55.950
Let me join you.

00:18:56.530 --> 00:18:58.650
You want to be buried, too, President?

00:18:58.650 --> 00:18:59.790
No!

00:18:59.790 --> 00:19:05.990
I want to mingle and flirt with all 
the chaste maidens in swimsuits!

00:19:06.320 --> 00:19:10.120
When you put it that way, 
I can feel a generation gap.

00:19:10.580 --> 00:19:12.210
Silence. I'll stomp you.

00:19:12.210 --> 00:19:14.480
You already are!

00:19:14.480 --> 00:19:15.800
President?

00:19:16.270 --> 00:19:18.430
I won't ask to join without paying for it.

00:19:18.430 --> 00:19:20.250
I've brought some gifts.

00:19:40.570 --> 00:19:41.780
Done already?

00:19:42.490 --> 00:19:44.610
I'm stuffed.

00:19:45.170 --> 00:19:48.290
Let's drink to the chaste maidens!

00:19:49.220 --> 00:19:51.000
Perfect!

00:19:51.660 --> 00:19:55.730
You're not actually here to watch 
girls in swimsuits, are you?

00:19:58.930 --> 00:20:03.130
Well, it was also to see how she's doing.

00:20:05.950 --> 00:20:08.160
I think she'll be okay.

00:20:08.760 --> 00:20:12.600
I'm sure she'll choose to be human.

00:20:13.170 --> 00:20:15.100
Choose, huh?

00:20:16.250 --> 00:20:18.790
Even if she were really a Dragon,

00:20:18.790 --> 00:20:21.820
if she chooses to live as a human, she can.

00:20:22.100 --> 00:20:28.310
I believe how you choose to live 
is more precious than what you are.

00:20:29.000 --> 00:20:30.150
President?

00:20:32.010 --> 00:20:33.090
All right!

00:20:33.090 --> 00:20:34.700
The party's just getting started!

00:20:34.700 --> 00:20:37.950
I'm going to go mingle and 
flirt with the chaste maidens!

00:20:38.250 --> 00:20:42.030
Sing and dance, maidens!

00:20:43.630 --> 00:20:45.160
It's just about time.

00:20:45.160 --> 00:20:47.760
Come on, not yet!

00:20:48.130 --> 00:20:50.180
L-Let go, Micah.

00:20:50.180 --> 00:20:52.100
Help me, comrade!

00:20:52.540 --> 00:20:55.020
We'll be off now.

00:20:55.020 --> 00:20:57.970
I need to mingle and flirt!

00:21:13.430 --> 00:21:16.520
It's the newest data on Kili.

00:21:18.380 --> 00:21:20.940
Kiri Surtr Muspelheim.

00:21:20.940 --> 00:21:22.010
Female.

00:21:22.010 --> 00:21:24.740
Approximately 160 centimeters tall.

00:21:24.740 --> 00:21:26.040
Age unknown.

00:21:26.040 --> 00:21:27.270
Nationality unknown.

00:21:28.050 --> 00:21:33.390
Acting as the leader of the Dragon cult 
organization since about three years ago.

00:21:33.930 --> 00:21:38.030
Suspected to be involved in over 
three hundred terrorist incidents.

00:21:38.520 --> 00:21:40.970
Burns things and people without 
so much as touching them.

00:21:40.970 --> 00:21:43.630
A D excelling in fire.

00:21:44.400 --> 00:21:48.470
She chose to live as a Dragon.

00:21:50.690 --> 00:21:54.630
<i>Tear can't become like her.</i>

00:23:39.810 --> 00:24:09.670
<b>Next Episode</b>

00:23:40.560 --> 00:23:42.270
The Blue Hecatoncheir.

00:23:42.270 --> 00:23:46.640
What do you think you're doing, 
showing up without my permission?

00:23:46.640 --> 00:23:50.370
I suppose I shouldn't even 
bother asking a Dragon.

00:23:50.370 --> 00:23:52.490
But I won't let you have Tear-san.

00:23:52.900 --> 00:23:55.190
She's an important member of our family.

00:23:55.850 --> 00:23:59.040
What is that, inside the red fire?

00:23:59.040 --> 00:24:00.740
What are you?

00:24:00.740 --> 00:24:03.260
Next time on <i>Unlimited Fafnir</i>:

00:24:03.260 --> 00:24:04.850
"Red-Winged Tiamat."

00:24:05.470 --> 00:24:08.940
Mononobe Yuu, you're going to show 
me what a reliable man is made of!

00:24:09.670 --> 00:24:24.910
<b>Illustration: Yuugen</b>
